CM_ BO_ 426 "FORK(HONDA_ACCORD_9G_AU), PROVISIONAL: sender unknown, 50 Hz, changes in the same 20 ms frame as the VSA's own. Checksum and counter checked on 7.6 million logged frames (0 checksum failures). NOT read by carstate";
CM_ SG_ 426 VSA_FAULT_LIVE_B2_0 "PROVISIONAL: set with B2_1 (byte 2 -> 0x03) in the VSA's live-fault onset frame, routes 110 and 112; never on another route";
CM_ SG_ 426 VSA_FAULT_LIVE_B2_1 "PROVISIONAL: see B2_0. Alone it also flickers for a few frames on three earlier routes, so it is no fault signal by itself";
